em_assets/steam/apps/3269310/57aa08040535c574016aa5ec213abafc33fd2530/ss_57aa08040535c574016aa5ec213abafc33fd2530.600x338.jpg?t=1743621316"}],"short_description":"Unleash your creativity in the Echoes of Elysium: Airship Builder! Craft and customize your airship ahead of the game's release. Echoes of Elysium is an airship survival RPG set in a procedural world where you will gather resources to design, build, and fight to survive on your full custom airships.","steam_appid":3269310,"support_info":{"email":"support@loricgames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.echoes.games/"}